<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>IA e Metodologias Ativas na Docência Corporativa · TRT4</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>

  :root{
    --ink:#14213A;
    --ink-2:#1C2F52;
    --brass:#B4883B;
    --brass-deep:#8F6A28;
    --brass-tint:#EFE3C8;
    --paper:#FBF9F4;
    --paper-2:#F3EEE1;
    --line:#E2DBC7;
    --text:#242B38;
    --muted:#6C7484;
    --sidebar-w:272px;
  }

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }

  html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{ scroll-behavior:auto; }
    *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }
  }

  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:"Inter", sans-serif;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.6;
  }

  h1,h2,h3,h4{
    font-family:"Fraunces", serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:0 0 .5em 0;
    line-height:1.15;
  }

  a{ color:inherit; }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.72rem;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:.6rem;
    margin-bottom:.9rem;
  }

  .numeral{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    width:26px;
    height:26px;
    border:1px solid var(--brass);
    border-radius:50%;
    font-size:.7rem;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
  }

  /* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */

  .sidebar{
    position:fixed;
    left:0; top:0;
    height:100vh;
    width:var(--sidebar-w);
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ink),var(--ink-2));
    color:#EDEFF5;
    padding:32px 26px;
    overflow-y:auto;
    z-index:50;
    border-right:1px solid rgba(180,136,59,.35);
  }

  .brand{
    font-family:"Fraunces", serif;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }

  .brand-sub{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.65rem;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass);
    opacity:.9;
  }

  .sidebar hr{
    border:none;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    margin:22px 0;
  }

  .nav-group-label{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.63rem;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(237,239,245,.4);
    margin:18px 0 8px 2px;
  }

  .nav-group-label:first-of-type{ margin-top:0; }

  .navlink{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:.65rem;
    color:rgba(237,239,245,.82);
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:.9rem;
    padding:8px 8px;
    border-radius:8px;
    margin-bottom:2px;
    transition:background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }

  .navlink:hover{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); color:#fff; }

  .navlink.active{
    background:rgba(180,136,59,.18);
    color:#fff;
  }

  .navlink.active .navlink-mark{ background:var(--brass); border-color:var(--brass); }

  .navlink-mark{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:22px;
    height:22px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.62rem;
    color:rgba(237,239,245,.85);
  }

  .navlink-dot{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:6px; height:6px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);
    margin:0 8px 0 2px;
  }

  /* ---------- Layout ---------- */

  .content{
    margin-left:var(--sidebar-w);
  }

  .section{
    padding:88px 56px;
    max-width:1080px;
  }

  .section-tight{ padding-top:0; }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */

  .hero-wrap{ padding:56px 56px 40px; max-width:1080px; }

  .hero{
    padding:76px 60px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 12%, rgba(180,136,59,.35), transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ink),var(--ink-2));
    color:#F4F1E8;
    border-radius:6px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid rgba(180,136,59,.4);
  }

  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:14px;
    border:1px solid rgba(244,241,232,.14);
    border-radius:2px;
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.75rem;
    letter-spacing:.2em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass);
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }

  .hero h1{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight:600;
    max-width:14ch;
    margin-bottom:.4em;
  }

  .hero .lead{
    font-size:1.1rem;
    max-width:52ch;
    color:rgba(244,241,232,.85);
    margin-bottom:1.6rem;
  }

  .tag-row{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:2.4rem;
  }

  .tag{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.72rem;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    padding:6px 12px;
    border:1px solid rgba(244,241,232,.3);
    border-radius:100px;
    color:rgba(244,241,232,.9);
  }

  .btn{
    font-family:"Inter", sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:.92rem;
    border:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:13px 26px;
    cursor:pointer;
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:.5rem;
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }

  .btn:focus-visible{ outline:3px solid var(--brass); outline-offset:2px; }

  .btn-brass{
    background:var(--brass);
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  .btn-brass:hover{ transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(180,136,59,.35); }

  .btn-outline{
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--ink);
    border:1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .btn-outline:hover{ background:var(--ink); color:#fff; }

  /* ---------- Cards ---------- */

  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:22px;
    margin-top:36px;
  }

  .grid-2{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }

  .card{
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:28px 26px;
    position:relative;
  }

  .card::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:0; left:26px;
    width:34px; height:3px;
    background:var(--brass);
  }

  .card h5, .card h4{ margin-bottom:.5em; }

  .card p{ color:var(--muted); font-size:.94rem; margin:0; }

  /* ---------- Bloom staircase ---------- */

  .bloom-card{ background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:30px; margin-top:36px; }

  .bloom-list{ list-style:none; margin:20px 0 0; padding:0; }

  .bloom-list li{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:14px;
    padding:11px 14px;
    border-radius:8px;
    margin-bottom:6px;
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.88rem;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  .bloom-list li span.lvl{
    font-size:.68rem;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
    width:20px;
  }

  .bloom-list li:nth-child(1){ background:#F4EEDD; width:64%; }
  .bloom-list li:nth-child(2){ background:#F0E6CC; width:72%; }
  .bloom-list li:nth-child(3){ background:#ECDFBC; width:80%; }
  .bloom-list li:nth-child(4){ background:#E8D8A9; width:88%; }
  .bloom-list li:nth-child(5){ background:#E3D096; width:94%; }
  .bloom-list li:nth-child(6){ background:var(--brass-tint); width:100%; font-weight:600; }

  .bloom-note{ font-size:.82rem; color:var(--muted); margin-top:16px; }

  /* ---------- Prompt lab ---------- */

  .lab-card{
    background:var(--ink);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:8px;
    margin-top:32px;
  }

  .lab-inner{
    background:#0F1B30;
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:34px;
  }

  .lab-label{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.7rem;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass);
    margin-bottom:16px;
  }

  .prompt-box{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.92rem;
    color:#EDEFF5;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    border-left:3px solid var(--brass);
    padding:22px 24px;
    white-space:pre-wrap;
    border-radius:4px;
    line-height:1.75;
  }

  .lab-footer{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin-top:20px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
  }

  .toast{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.8rem;
    color:var(--brass);
    opacity:0;
    transition:opacity .25s ease;
  }

  .toast.show{ opacity:1; }

  /* ---------- Collaborative ---------- */

  .placeholder-card{
    border:1.5px dashed var(--brass);
    background:var(--brass-tint);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:26px 28px;
    margin-top:26px;
    display:flex;
    gap:16px;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }

  .placeholder-badge{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.68rem;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid var(--brass);
    padding:4px 10px;
    border-radius:100px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }

  /* ---------- Accordion ---------- */

  .accordion-item{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:8px;
    margin-top:14px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:#fff;
  }

  .accordion-header{
    width:100%;
    text-align:left;
    background:none;
    border:none;
    padding:18px 22px;
    font-family:"Inter", sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:.98rem;
    color:var(--ink);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    cursor:pointer;
  }

  .accordion-header:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--brass); outline-offset:-2px; }

  .accordion-plus{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
    transition:transform .2s ease;
  }

  .accordion-item.open .accordion-plus{ transform:rotate(45deg); }

  .accordion-body{
    max-height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:max-height .25s ease;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.94rem;
  }

  .accordion-body-inner{ padding:0 22px 20px; }

  /* ---------- Extras ---------- */

  .extra{
    background:var(--paper-2);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .extra-list{
    list-style:none;
    margin:26px 0 0;
    padding:0;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:14px 32px;
  }

  .extra-list li{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
    font-size:.96rem;
    color:var(--text);
  }

  .extra-list li::before{
    content:"";
    width:7px; height:7px;
    background:var(--brass);
    transform:rotate(45deg);
    flex:0 0 auto;
  }

  /* ---------- Plan of action ---------- */

  .plan-card{
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:34px;
    margin-top:32px;
  }

  .plan-item{
    display:flex;
    gap:18px;
    padding:20px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .plan-item:first-of-type{ border-top:none; padding-top:6px; }

  .plan-num{
    font-family:"Fraunces", serif;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:42px;
  }

  .plan-item input{
    width:100%;
    margin-top:8px;
    border:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    background:transparent;
    font-family:"Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size:.94rem;
    padding:8px 2px;
    color:var(--text);
  }

  .plan-item input:focus{ outline:none; border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--brass); }
  .plan-item input::placeholder{ color:#B3B8C2; }

  /* ---------- About / Sobre ---------- */

  .about-card{
    display:flex;
    gap:34px;
    align-items:center;
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:32px;
    margin-top:32px;
  }

  .about-photo{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:132px;
    height:132px;
    border-radius:50%;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--brass-tint);
    border:3px solid var(--brass);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }

  .about-photo img{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    display:block;
  }

  .about-photo .initials{
    font-family:"Fraunces", serif;
    font-size:2.4rem;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
  }

  .about-body h4{ margin-bottom:.15em; }

  .about-role{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size:.78rem;
    letter-spacing:.03em;
    color:var(--brass-deep);
    margin-bottom:14px;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  .about-contacts{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
    margin-top:16px;
  }

  .contact-pill{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-family:"Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size:.86rem;
    font-weight:500;
    padding:9px 16px;
    border-radius:100px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--text);
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }

  .contact-pill:hover{ border-color:var(--brass); background:var(--brass-tint); }

  .contact-pill.disabled{
    color:var(--muted);
    border-style:dashed;
    cursor:default;
  }

  .contact-pill.disabled:hover{ background:none; border-color:var(--line); }

  .contact-icon{ font-size:1rem; line-height:1; }

  @media (max-width:600px){
    .about-card{ flex-direction:column; text-align:center; }
    .about-contacts{ justify-content:center; }
  }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */

  footer{
    padding:50px 56px 60px;
    text-align:center;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }

  footer p{ margin:.2em 0; }
  footer .foot-main{ font-family:"Fraunces", serif; color:var(--ink); }
  footer .foot-sub{ font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.08em; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; }

  /* ---------- Scroll reveal ---------- */

  .reveal{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px); transition:opacity .5s ease, transform .5s ease; }
  .reveal.in{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .sidebar{
      position:fixed;
      width:100%;
      height:auto;
      max-height:64px;
      padding:0;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      overflow:visible;
      border-right:none;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(180,136,59,.35);
    }
    .sidebar.open{ max-height:100vh; flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; overflow-y:auto; padding:18px 22px 26px; }
    .sidebar-top{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; width:100%; padding:0 20px; height:64px; flex:0 0 auto; }
    .sidebar.open .sidebar-top{ padding:0 0 14px; height:auto; }
    .sidebar-scroll{ display:none; }
    .sidebar.open .sidebar-scroll{ display:block; }
    #menuToggle{ background:none; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); color:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:8px 12px; font-family:"IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size:.8rem; cursor:pointer; }
    .content{ margin-left:0; margin-top:64px; }
    .section{ padding:56px 22px; }
    .hero-wrap{ padding:32px 22px 24px; }
    .hero{ padding:44px 26px; }
    .grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .grid-2{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .extra-list{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="sidebar" id="sidebar">

  <div class="sidebar-top">
    <div>
      <span class="brand">Formação TRT4</span>
      <span class="brand-sub">IA · Docência Corporativa</span>
    </div>
    <button id="menuToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sidebar">Menu</button>
  </div>

  <div class="sidebar-scroll">
    <hr>

    <div class="nav-group-label">Início</div>
    <a class="navlink" href="#inicio" data-target="inicio"><span class="navlink-dot"></span>Apresentação</a>

    <div class="nav-group-label">Percurso</div>
    <a class="navlink" href="#bloco1" data-target="bloco1"><span class="navlink-mark">I</span>Bloco 1 — Fundamentos</a>
    <a class="navlink" href="#bloco2" data-target="bloco2"><span class="navlink-mark">II</span>Bloco 2 — Engenharia &amp; Bloom</a>
    <a class="navlink" href="#bloco3" data-target="bloco3"><span class="navlink-mark">III</span>Bloco 3 — Materiais</a>

    <div class="nav-group-label">Prática</div>
    <a class="navlink" href="#laboratorio" data-target="laboratorio"><span class="navlink-dot"></span>Laboratório de Prompts</a>
    <a class="navlink" href="#colaborativo" data-target="colaborativo"><span class="navlink-dot"></span>Espaço Colaborativo</a>
    <a class="navlink" href="#prompts" data-target="prompts"><span class="navlink-dot"></span>Promptoteca</a>

    <div class="nav-group-label">Para ir além</div>
    <a class="navlink" href="#extras" data-target="extras"><span class="navlink-dot"></span>Conteúdo Avançado</a>
    <a class="navlink" href="#encerramento" data-target="encerramento"><span class="navlink-dot"></span>Plano de Ação</a>

    <div class="nav-group-label">Facilitação</div>
    <a class="navlink" href="#sobre" data-target="sobre"><span class="navlink-dot"></span>Sobre a Facilitadora</a>
  </div>

</nav>

<div class="content">

  <section id="inicio" class="hero-wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Formação Continuada · TRT4</div>
      <h1>Inteligência Artificial e Metodologias Ativas na Docência Corporativa</h1>
      <p class="lead">Um percurso prático para levar IA generativa e metodologias ativas ao planejamento de cursos internos — do diagnóstico do público ao design das atividades.</p>
      <div class="tag-row">
        <span class="tag">Google Gemini</span>
        <span class="tag">NotebookLM</span>
        <span class="tag">Taxonomia de Bloom</span>
        <span class="tag">Metodologias Ativas</span>
      </div>
      <a href="#bloco1" class="btn btn-brass">Começar a formação →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal" id="bloco1">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="numeral">I</span>Bloco 1</div>
    <h2>Fundamentos da Aprendizagem Corporativa</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted); max-width:60ch;">Antes de produzir qualquer material com IA, é preciso entender quem aprende — e o que já se sabe sobre esse público.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h5>Andragogia</h5>
        <p>Características do adulto aprendiz: experiência prévia, orientação prática e motivação para aplicar o conhecimento de imediato.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h5>Diagnóstico</h5>
        <p>Mapeamento de competências e lacunas de aprendizagem com apoio de IA, para calibrar o curso ao público real.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h5>Prompts</h5>
        <p>Engenharia de prompts aplicada à educação: como estruturar pedidos para obter planos, rubricas e materiais consistentes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal" id="bloco2">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="numeral">II</span>Bloco 2</div>
    <h2>Engenharia de Cursos e Taxonomia de Bloom</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted); max-width:60ch;">Estruturar objetivos de aprendizagem em níveis crescentes de complexidade — e usar o NotebookLM para transformar documentos em base de estudo.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="bloom-card">
        <h4>Taxonomia de Bloom</h4>
        <ul class="bloom-list">
          <li><span class="lvl">01</span>Lembrar</li>
          <li><span class="lvl">02</span>Compreender</li>
          <li><span class="lvl">03</span>Aplicar</li>
          <li><span class="lvl">04</span>Analisar</li>
          <li><span class="lvl">05</span>Avaliar</li>
          <li><span class="lvl">06</span>Criar</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="bloom-note">A largura de cada barra acompanha o nível de complexidade cognitiva exigido.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between;">
        <div>
          <h4>NotebookLM</h4>
